  /sys/devices/system/cpu/intel_uncore_frequency/package_00_die_00/{min,max,initial_min,initial_max}_freq_khz = 800000/4000000/800000/4000000.
- caps: `scaling_max_freq` per CPU (kHz = ratio*100000); E-cluster caps written for all 4 CPUs of the cluster (G-152 rule; topology from the live
